			"notes": "- Added a new Remote Control item.\n- Crafting recipe: place Redstone Dust in the center, with Iron Nuggets on the top, bottom, left, and right.\n- Hold Alt + Right Click on a TV screen to bind the Remote Control to that TV.\n- Once bound, Right Click in the air from any distance to open the TV's advanced control panel.\n- Alt + Right Click in the air to unbind the Remote Control.\n- Each Remote Control can only be bound to one TV at a tim\n\n- 为模组新增遥控器，遥控器通过中间一个红石粉，上下左右各一个铁粒制作，对屏幕按住alt+右键即可绑定电视，绑定后远距离对着空气按右键可直接打开电视的详细控制面板，远距离对着空气按alt+右键可以取消绑定，一个遥控器只能绑定一个电视。"
