			"notes": "1. Added a browser zoom feature. The zoom level can now be adjusted using Ctrl + mouse wheel, providing a better browsing experience on smaller displays (such as 3×2 screens).\n\n2. Added playback mode settings to the mod configuration. The default mode pauses after the video ends, but you can also enable loop playback. It might even be used as a dynamic wallpaper on a wall .\n\n\n> 1、为浏览器增加了缩放功能，可以通过ctrl+滚轮的方式控制缩放，能让较小尺寸的屏幕上（如3*2的屏幕）获得更好的浏览效果；\n\n> 2、mod设置添加了播放模式，默认播完暂停，还可以设置循环播放，或许能放在墙上当动态壁纸（雾）。"
		},
