			"notes": "### Changes:\nRedesigned display blocks to better match vanilla Minecraft block styles. They now have no collision box and a thinner appearance, making them easier to integrate into builds.\n\nAdded a mod configuration screen with browser homepage customization, a homepage button in the control UI, browser cache clearing, and video quality selection options.\n\nImproved Bilibili compatibility playback. Local video caching is no longer used; videos are now downloaded and played in real time. (Note: seeking may no longer be available.) On servers, only playback timing is synchronized. Video quality and playback performance depend on each client's own decoding capabilities and settings.\n\n\n### 更新内容：\n\n1、显示器方块现更改为类似原版画一样的方块样式，无碰撞体积而且会显得更加轻薄，更方便融入在建筑中了；\n\n2、新增mod设置页面，可在其中设置浏览器的首页，在操作UI中也加入了主页按钮，方便跳转，同时也增加了浏览器缓存清理、视频解析画质选择；\n\n3、更改了B站视频兼容播放逻辑，不再生成本地缓存，改用边转边播的形式（但这样好像就不能拖动进度条了），服务器中视频播放只会同步播放时刻，但实际播放清晰度和效果依赖各客户端独立解析能力和设置（比如大家看同一个屏幕会同时开始在各自客户端解析对应视频，并按各自mod设置中的画质播放）。"
		},
